  "rawText": "Lemon Basil Pesto\n- 2 cups/big handfuls raw spinach\n- 1 small bunch basil (3/4 cup)\n- 2 garlic cloves\n- 1/2 cup Parmesan\n- 1/2 cup toasted walnuts/pine nuts\n- 1 tablespoon lemon juice + some zest (optional)\n- 1/2 teaspoon salt\n- 1/4 teaspoon black pepper\n- 1/2 cup olive oil\n\nAlways retain pasta water",
